{"id":"steam-760250","steam":760250,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"MUKTI","summary":"A narrative driven first-person thriller that bridges the past with the present.","about":"Mukti is a first-person narrative adventure set within the immersive environment of an Indian museum. \n\nBlurring the lines between game and cinema, Mukti delves deeply into a critical social issue that demands our attention: human trafficking.  Through rich storytelling and immersive gameplay mechanics, Mukti invites players to confront the realities faced by victims and survivors alike, shedding light on this pressing global issue.\n\n\"PlayStation-Backed Indian Gaming Studio Casts Film Stars for Narrative Adventure ‘Mukti’\" - Variety\n\n\"A journey of discovery, redemption, and the impact of hidden narratives.\" - PlayStation Blog\n\n\"Mukti game puts Indian stories on the world stage with gripping new trailer\" - PCQuest\n\n\"Why Mukti Could Be the ‘Gone Home’ of Indian Gaming\" - The Quest unlocked\n\n\"Sony's PS5 Indie Program Might Have Found Another Winner\" - Push Square\n\n\"‘Mukti’ Brings India to the Forefront of the Adventure Genre in a Stunning New First-Person Title\" - VICE\n\nLaunching on PlayStation 5 and PC, Mukti offers an impactful gaming experience that enlightens and empowers. Join us on this transformative journey to make a difference.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760250/portrait.png?t=1757610797","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760250/d27896db1490932b9fb365abe746e73ab1be690e/header.jpg?t=1757610797","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760250/cb3aec4ae5b47c3a3536287c8188dc88dde8f90d/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1757610797","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760250/d27896db1490932b9fb365abe746e73ab1be690e/header.jpg?t=1757610797","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset